  "evidencia": "Page: Irad Ortiz Jr.. Sentence: He won his first Breeders' Cup race on Lady Eli in 2014, and his first American Classic on Creator in the 2016 Belmont Stakes.\nPage: 2016 Belmont Stakes. Sentence: The 1+1/2 mi race, known as the \"test of the champion\", is the final jewel in Thoroughbred horse racing's American Triple Crown series, and was held on June 11, 2016, three weeks after the Preakness Stakes and five weeks after the Kentucky Derby.",
