        "original_id": "a0568484-ab84-525c-a0e1-abb41ba1d42d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Irad Ortiz Jr.\n- Horses: Lady Eli, Creator\n- Events: Breeders' Cup, 2016 Belmont Stakes, Preakness Stakes, Kentucky Derby, American Triple Crown\n- Concepts: American Classic, Thoroughbred horse racing\n\nFacts:\n- Irad Ortiz Jr. won his first Breeders' Cup race on Lady Eli in 2014.\n- The 2016 Belmont Stakes was held on June 11, 2016.\n- The 2016 Belmont Stakes took place three weeks after the Preakness Stakes and five weeks after the Kentucky Derby.\n- The 2016 Belmont Stakes was a 1+1/2 mi Thoroughbred horse race known as the \"test of the champion.\"\n- The 2016 Belmont Stakes was the final jewel in Thoroughbred horse racing's American Triple Crown series.\n- Irad Ortiz Jr. won his first American Classic on Creator in the 2016 Belmont Stakes.",
